# A maintenance window holds a down machine's roles for good, past its
# length: the coordinator never re-places them. The heal predicate names a
# member under maintenance only while the harness's own window holds
# (#741), so the journal must be judged once the windows ended.
expect: survives #1177
cause: heal: no journal waits on a member under maintenance
cause: heal: no control journal waits on a member under maintenance
cause: heal: no matchmaker set waits on a member under maintenance
file: crates/lib/paros-coordinator/src/cell/watch.rs
--- find
                .is_some_and(|(_, seen)| now < *seen + Duration::from_millis(window.for_ms))
--- replace
                .is_some()
--- end
